%% alt: Mind map of the four measurement scales. Nominal means names only (city, colour). Ordinal means an order without equal gaps (small, medium, large). Interval means equal gaps but no true zero (temperature in Celsius). Ratio means a true zero (rent, age, distance).
mindmap
  root((Measurement scales))
    Nominal
      names only
      city, colour
    Ordinal
      order, unequal gaps
      small, medium, large
    Interval
      equal gaps
      no true zero
      temperature in °C
    Ratio
      true zero
      rent, age, distance
